{"id":55796,"ord":23,"n_segments":127,"prev":55795,"next":55797,"doc":{"id":"68097","title":"68097_Freddie Green oral history interview","collection":"rutgers","inst":"Rutgers — Institute of Jazz Studies","interviewee":"Freddie Green","interviewer":"","date":"","year":"","source_url":"https://rucore.libraries.rutgers.edu/rutgers-lib/68097/","url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68097"},"chapter":"Coming to New York","title":"Hell's Kitchen migration and Harlem jumping","category":"venue_city_scene","summary":"He agrees people drifted out of Hell's Kitchen and that Harlem was where things were happening when he was about fifteen.","period":"c. 1926","year_from":1926,"year_to":1926,"words":143,"start":[43,15],"end":[44,20],"url":"https://semlab.io/linked-jazz-transcripts/?t=68097#s55796","tags":{"places":[{"name":"Hell's Kitchen","focus":1,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"},{"name":"Harlem","focus":1,"type":"neighborhood","in":"New York"}],"venues":[],"bands":[]},"people":[],"story":{"theme":36,"theme_name":"Coming to New York: clubs, jams, and making it","community":73,"community_name":"Making it in New York: arrival, clubs and the scene","core":false},"blocks":[{"p":43,"b":15,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"But that Hell's Kitchen thing."},{"p":43,"b":16,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":43,"b":17,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Uh, there was a sort of general migration out of it, wasn't there?"},{"p":43,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Oh, yes. Yes. you know, that"},{"p":43,"b":19,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"It didn't stay the way it was,"},{"p":43,"b":20,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No, no. It didn't."},{"p":43,"b":21,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"No. That's right."},{"p":43,"b":22,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"No."},{"p":43,"b":23,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah, I guess that's right. It was a natural impression."},{"p":44,"b":0,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. --progression."},{"p":44,"b":1,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Well, -- but in a sense, I mean, it must have been more lively or more --broader horizon up there wasn't it?"},{"p":44,"b":2,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Well, everything seemed -- it was happening, you know, in Harlem, in other words."},{"p":44,"b":3,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah. It was jumping?"},{"p":44,"b":4,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"-- Up there --. It was jumping, yes."},{"p":44,"b":5,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"You were by then sixteen, maybe?"},{"p":44,"b":6,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Yeah. About sixteen."},{"p":44,"b":7,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":44,"b":8,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":44,"b":9,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Well didn't --"},{"p":44,"b":10,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Let's see. No. Maybe not sixteen. Maybe fifteen."},{"p":44,"b":11,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah?"},{"p":44,"b":12,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Maybe fifteen."},{"p":44,"b":13,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"That would make it about 1926."},{"p":44,"b":14,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Right."},{"p":44,"b":15,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"It's about right."},{"p":44,"b":16,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":44,"b":18,"s":"MR. GREENE","x":"Yeah. Yeah. Yeah."},{"p":44,"b":19,"s":"MRS. DANCE","x":"Yeah."},{"p":44,"b":20,"s":"MR. DANCE","x":"Yeah."}]}